    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwami Ahazia wi Ivuyuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu va vingilira ahokososa, ha Vandu va Isiraeli ma niviita avayaayi vosi vu mwami Jehoramu; nitali Ahazia, muyaayi mukogoti. Kunangwa avandu va Jerusalemi vaakora Ahazia, kuva mwami mu vogono vwa baba weve mwami Jehoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazia yaali ni mihiga 22",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sirini na mbiri:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Henza 2 Avami 8:26 vitabu vilala via kale vivoola ndio navuzwa chu Luheburaina kevoolaa 42.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " lwa yagwa mwami wi Ivuyuda. Yamiha mu Jerusalemi ku muhiga mulala. Mama weve yaali Azalia, mukaana wa Ahabuna mwisukulu wu mwami Omuri wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazia yalonda liiva lia vinyumba ya Ahabu, kigira mama weve yamuha zing'anagani iziamwimilira kuduuka mu likora uvudamanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakola uvwoni imbiri wa Yahova, kuli avinyumba ya Ahabu vaali nivakoli, kigira inyima wi likuza lia baba weve, vahaana zing'anagani ziavula kumukonya, na ya duuka mu liigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalonda kandi zing'anagani ziavo zia vamuha lwa yazia kuhambana harara na Joramu muyaayi wu mwami Ahabu wa Isiraeli kuzia kulwaana mwami Hazaeli wa Aramu ha Ramozi mu kivala cha Gileadi. Vandu va Siria vaatoza Joramu ligali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yirana mu lidaala linene, lia Jezireeli kulwalizirwa yo zing'oma zizie zia vamwata ha Ramozi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ramozi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Rama.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Ahazia muyaayi wa Jehoramu mwami wa Ivuyuda yazia kolola Joramu muyaayi wa Ahabu kigira yaali niyatiywi zing'oma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye yatumikira liluuta yili ku Joramu okolomba Ahazia. Lwa Ahazia yaali naveeye yo, Jehu muyaayi wa Nimushi, uwa Yahova yaali natovoye ukudiviza uvwami vwa avinyumba ya Ahabu yagana navo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Jehu yaali naadukizaa lilago lia Nyasaye ku vwami vwa vinyumba ya Ahabu, yanyoora avanene vi Ivuyuda kandi avayaayi va vamwavo Ahazia avaari nivamuheleki, na yaviita vosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu yenyeleriza Ahazia mbitilira, na vandu veve vagumira Ahazia lwa yaali niyivisi mu Samaria. Vamuleeta ku Jehu ma naamwita. Vaamuta vuzwa kigira vavoola, “Yaali mwisukulu wa Jehoshafati, uwahulira Yahova nu mwoyo gwigwe gwosi.” Kunangwa sihali ho nu mulala munyumba ya Ahazia uwaali nizinguru kuzizagiliriza uvwami mba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwami wikikali Azalia wi Ivuyuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonoho lwa mama wu mwami Ahazia yahulira iliitwa liu muyaayi weve, yahaana malago ndi avinyumba yu vwami vwi Ivuyuda vosi viitwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazia yaali na mbozo weve Jehosheba, uwaali niyaazia lukali ku musaalisi Jehoyada. Yahonyia mu vuvisi Joashi mulala ku vayaayi va Ahazia naamuhira ihale kutura ku vana vumwami vosi avaari himbi kwitwa. Yamuvisa harara numuleri kandi naamulelera mu keng'oze kilala chi Litembeli. Ku limuvisa, Jehosheba yamuhonyia kutura ku liitwa na Azalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamuvisa mu Litembeli lia Nyasaye ku mihiga sita lwa Azalia yaamiihaa kivala chi Ivuyuda kuli mwami wikikali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
